 FileValidator calls non-existant UploadFile methods.\nI've created a simple file upload form. And it doesn`t work.\n\nFileValidator. For example, Line 171.\n\n``` php\n    switch ($file->getError()) {\n```\n\nThere is no such method in UploadedFile, so __call() adds 'get' to the method name  \n\n``` php\n    public function __call($name, $params)\n    {\n        $getter = 'get' . $name;\n```\n\nand checks if method exists \"getgetError\". This is false, and we get UnknownMethodException.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/23858409/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"mo4islona","id":589175,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU4OTE3NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/589175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mo4islona","html_url":"https://github.com/mo4islona","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mo4islona/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mo4islona/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mo4islona/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mo4islona/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mo4islona/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mo4islona/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mo4islona/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mo4islona/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mo4islona/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":63989533,"node_id":"MDEzOkFzc2lnbmVkRXZlbnQ2Mzk4OTUzMw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/events/63989533","actor":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id